id=wandr-stack
name=wandr Hybrid runtime stack
version=v0.2.0
versionCode=2
author=harry
description=Boots the device straight into the wandr --no-art stack as default: stops the Java framework (system_server) and brings up the native+shim layer, inputflinger, zygote, arbiter, and chrome/launcher/keyguard/power-menu. Reversible: touch /data/adb/modules/wandr-stack/disable to skip (stock Android), or .../remove to uninstall on next reboot.
